<br>&nbsp;

The call vspl_load_d2d loads the file <i>fname</i> from the
position <i>position</i> into memory for D2D playback.
<br>&nbsp;

The call vspl_make_d2d continues the D2D playback of the file
previously started with <a href="/historical/de/vspl-play-d2d/">vspl_play_d2d</a>.
<br>&nbsp;
<br>The D2D status should be checked regularly with <a href="/historical/de/vqspl-status-d2d/">vqspl_status_d2d</a>
in order to call vspl_make_d2d whenever the system is ready.
<br>&nbsp;
<br>During this loop, <a href="/historical/de/buffoper/">buffoper</a>(-1) has the bit 0 set to 1 throughout
